{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"cook_hut","model_identifier":"cook_hut","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# cook_hut\n\nCook hut (kitchen tier 2): a mud-and-wattle hut with one chimney, a hanging sign and a cooking bench outside.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 6 columns (96 x 96 units, 2.70 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -60..36, y 0..106, z -42..43 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 50, construction_0 26, construction_33 31, construction_66 46, ruined 31 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 72 x 104 x 64 centred at x 0, z 4\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `cook_hut_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `cook_hut_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_cook_hut` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 2.4 | loop | `sign` swings. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -37)\n- `fx_smoke` at (22, 107, 20)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"hut_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-34.0,0.0,-30.0],"to":[34.0,3.0,38.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[156.0,281.0,224.0,284.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,284.0,68.0,287.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[156.0,281.0,224.0,284.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,284.0,68.0,287.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[65.0,116.0,133.0,184.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[65.0,116.0,133.0,184.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"56fc866c-1ac5-58c0-8982-ea3cdcfc626f"},{"name":"hut_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-32.0,3.0,-28.0],"to":[32.0,55.0,-24.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[161.0,116.0,225.0,168.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[68.0,194.0,72.0,246.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[161.0,116.0,225.0,168.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[68.0,194.0,72.0,246.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[6.0,256.0,70.0,260.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[6.0,256.0,70.0,260.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9e79bba8-5a74-5fa9-81ec-5a67d0fc0655"},{"name":"hut_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-32.0,3.0,32.0],"to":[32.0,55.0,36.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[161.0,116.0,225.0,168.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[72.0,194.0,76.0,246.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[161.0,116.0,225.0,168.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[72.0,194.0,76.0,246.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[70.0,256.0,134.0,260.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[70.0,256.0,134.0,260.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c276863d-23b8-5f47-a730-275eedd62b48"},{"name":"hut_w0_w","box_uv":f